{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05195","headline":"初出京邑有怀旧林 · 卢僎","name":"初出京邑有怀旧林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赋生期独得，素业守微班。\n外忝文学知，鸿渐鵷鹭间。\n内倾水木趣，筑室依近山。\n晨趋天日[晏]，夕卧江海闲。\n松风生坐隅，仙禽舞亭湾。\n曙云林下客，霁月池上颜。\n虽曰坐郊园，静默非人寰。\n时步苍龙阙，宁异白云关。\n语济岂时顾，默善忘世攀。\n世网余何触，天涯谪南蛮。\n回首思洛阳，喟然悲贞艰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢僎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}